      "kind": "note",
      "text": "E4M3FN payload and one BF16 inverse scale per 128 × 128 block per matrix. Coverage from the full checkpoint index and dtypes from pinned Safetensors headers. DeltaNet A_log and gated norm weights use FP32. Input/output activations, KV and other state retain the authored text graph formats. This preset models checkpoint weight residency and corresponding memory traffic. Matrix execution uses the declared BF16 analytical baseline; dynamic activation scales, conversion kernels and native FP8 execution require separate definitions."
    }
